1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,390
Thank you, everybody, for coming to my workshop.

2
00:00:02,805 --> 00:00:10,400
Because the theme of this summer's event is alternative energy, we're going to do a hands-on activity which I'm pretty sure you will enjoy.

3
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:14,330
We're going to spend the next hour or so making solar ovens.

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,175
That's right.

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:21,120
One hour from now, you'll have made an oven that doesn't require electricity or gas to operate.

6
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,510
It only needs the light of the sun.

7
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:33,335
Unfortunately, since the weather is overcast today, we can't go outside to use them, but as soon as there's a sunny day, you'll be able to test them yourselves.

8
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,605
So let's get started.
